    <briefdescription>
<para>Toggles AR lighting estimation and URP main-light rendering in response to PopupMenuManager.OnEnableLightning. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses reflection to set the private <computeroutput>m_MainLightRenderingMode</computeroutput> field on the URP asset because no public API is available in URP 17. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
